          "content": "Content source: Gabriel Paredes CV in tests/fixtures. Qualifications: NIT IT Telecommunications (2025), NIT IT Cybersecurity (2024), UTN Mechatronics Engineering (2019). NIT Connect: 20 workshops and 249 participants. Visual previews are conceptual, not real product screenshots. No portrait is inferred from the reference.",
